# Scratch from the remote-session file bridge.
#
# `device_bash` cannot unlink, so git lock files and transfer tarballs get MOVED
# to _to_delete/ instead of removed, and `.probe-*.ts` are esbuild entry points
# a probe writes beside the source and deletes on the way out. All of it is
# machine-local rubbish; 09ff653 swept about 1.7MB of it into the branch.
_to_delete/
.probe-*.ts
.*-entry.ts
